  <ferc:BasisAmortizationCharges id="f-2579" contextRef="c-1">Amortization charges to account 404 primarily consist of amortization of capital obligations for certain transmission property construction funding by UNS Electric in accordance with the current transmission agreement between the Company and WAPA. The capital obligations are amortized over the economic life of the transmission property constructed.</ferc:BasisAmortizationCharges>
  <ferc:RegulatoryCommissionDescription id="f-2580" contextRef="c-467">Misc. expenses pertaining to Rate Case Filing to the Arizona Corporation Commission for the test year ended June 30, 2022. In Decision 79277, Commission approved $1,061,217 of rate case expense to be amortized over a 3-year period, effective February 1, 2024.</ferc:RegulatoryCommissionDescription>
